The Microduck 3D model files (the STL meshes these scenes compile in) are licensed
under Creative Commons BY-SA-NC by Pollen Robotics, stated in the source repository's
README (https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl#license):

    "This project is licensed under the Apache 2.0 License. [...]
     3D model files are licensed under Creative Commons BY-SA-NC."

Upstream names no version and ships no license text. The identifier above is the same
license under SPDX's spelling at the current CC version, whose terms are at

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

NonCommercial and ShareAlike both bear on redistributing a scene that contains these
meshes. The copies on mjswan Cloud are up there under permission granted directly by
the author; that permission does not travel with the files.
